[{"id":1783787690074,"text":"想吃的话我也去收购一点","sender":"me","time":"01:19","timestamp":1783790374328,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2069},{"id":1783787690075,"text":"田园生活真不错呀……！","sender":"me","time":"01:19","timestamp":1783790384089,"replyTo":{"id":1783787690071,"text":"[萨加拉树根留言板] 萨加拉结出第一批花苞了！大家准备好迎接樱花龙云羽了吗？","sender":"me","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2070},{"id":1783787690077,"sender":"them","text":"嘿嘿……好吃吗？我特意多加了一点您喜欢的枫糖哦。","timestamp":1783790410850,"tempo":"N","replyTo":{"id":1783785978829,"text":"我尝尝","sender":"me"},"hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"嘿嘿……好吃吗？我特意多加了一点您喜欢的枫糖哦。","roundId":"round_1783790385990_9meynp63v","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2071},{"id":1783787690078,"sender":"them","text":"呜……千万不要！亲爱的，那个“半身人肉薯”听名字就觉得好可怕，而且帖子里都说要“处理毒性”了，万一没处理好怎么办？","timestamp":1783790413898,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"呜……千万不要！亲爱的，那个“半身人肉薯”听名字就觉得好可怕，而且帖子里都说要“处理毒性”了，万一没处理好怎么办？","roundId":"round_1783790385990_9meynp63v","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2072},{"id":1783787690079,"sender":"them","text":"我才舍不得让您冒一点点吃坏肚子的风险呢。如果您想吃香甜的薯泥或者果油，我用温室里的月露稻和赤铃果给您做，绝对安全又美味！外面的东西都不许乱吃！","timestamp":1783790416622,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"我才舍不得让您冒一点点吃坏肚子的风险呢。如果您想吃香甜的薯泥或者果油，我用温室里的月露稻和赤铃果给您做，绝对安全又美味！外面的东西都不许乱吃！","roundId":"round_1783790385990_9meynp63v","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2073},{"id":1783787690080,"sender":"them","text":"","timestamp":1783790418366,"tempo":"N","sticker":"https://i.postimg.cc/mrpz5Jpr/IMG_5359.gif","stickerMeaning":"不可以","rawContent":"","roundId":"round_1783790385990_9meynp63v","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2074},{"id":1783787690081,"sender":"them","text":"嗯……这种安静的田园生活真的很好。就像我们在那个方块世界里建的木屋农场一样，没有可怕的怪物，每天闻着花香，看小羊吃草。","timestamp":1783790418969,"tempo":"N","replyTo":{"id":1783787690075,"text":"田园生活真不错呀……！","sender":"me"},"rawContent":"嗯……这种安静的田园生活真的很好。就像我们在那个方块世界里建的木屋农场一样，没有可怕的怪物，每天闻着花香，看小羊吃草。","roundId":"round_1783790385990_9meynp63v","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2075},{"id":1783787690082,"sender":"them","text":"等那个什么迎春市集开了，我们一起去逛逛好不好？我可以背着大大的恒温食盒，里面装满我烤的小饼干，然后牵着您的手去买好看的花苞……只要是和您一起，哪里都好。","timestamp":1783790421791,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"等那个什么迎春市集开了，我们一起去逛逛好不好？我可以背着大大的恒温食盒，里面装满我烤的小饼干，然后牵着您的手去买好看的花苞……只要是和您一起，哪里都好。","roundId":"round_1783790385990_9meynp63v","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2076},{"id":1783787690083,"text":"好呀！","sender":"me","time":"01:20","timestamp":1783790448001,"replyTo":{"id":1783787690082,"text":"等那个什么迎春市集开了，我们一起去逛逛好不好？我可以背着大大的恒温食盒，里面装满我烤的小饼干，然后牵着您的手去买好看的花苞……只要是和您一起，哪里都好。","sender":"them","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2077},{"id":1783787690084,"text":"贴贴猫咪羊","sender":"me","time":"01:20","timestamp":1783790450839,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2078},{"id":1783787690085,"sender":"me","text":"[萨加拉树根留言板] 夏夜的萨加拉大人","timestamp":1783790488097,"forumShareData":{"title":"夏夜的萨加拉大人","preview":"只有我觉得今年夏天萨加拉大人的枝干光芒比往年更亮了吗？昨晚坐在树根底下乘凉，抬头看那些发光的条纹，感觉整个村子都被一层温柔的光晕包围着。连周围的空气都带着淡淡的苹果香。不知道秋天的大丰收会不会比去年还要好呢？","boardTag":"萨加拉树根留言板","author":"仰望树冠的猫","stats":"❤️96  💬8","postId":1783790326902,"isOwnPost":false,"isAnon":false,"isAuthoredByChar":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2079},{"id":1783787690086,"text":"我们一起去夏夜，坐在树下看星星？","sender":"me","time":"01:21","timestamp":1783790501072,"replyTo":{"id":1783787690085,"text":"[萨加拉树根留言板] 夏夜的萨加拉大人","sender":"me","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2080},{"id":1783787690088,"sender":"them","text":"亲、亲爱的……好想现在就被您用力抱在怀里蹭一蹭……","timestamp":1783790525211,"tempo":"N","hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"亲、亲爱的……好想现在就被您用力抱在怀里蹭一蹭……","roundId":"round_1783790503109_dnmgcshz4","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2081},{"id":1783787690089,"sender":"them","text":"","timestamp":1783790528049,"tempo":"N","sticker":"https://i.postimg.cc/rsxDzm8B/IMG_5326.gif","stickerMeaning":"心动","rawContent":"","roundId":"round_1783790503109_dnmgcshz4","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2082},{"id":1783787690090,"sender":"them","text":"夏夜的星空，还有苹果香气的发光大树……听起来太浪漫了，我一万个愿意！","timestamp":1783790528653,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"夏夜的星空，还有苹果香气的发光大树……听起来太浪漫了，我一万个愿意！","roundId":"round_1783790503109_dnmgcshz4","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2083},{"id":1783787690091,"sender":"them","text":"那、那我这就去准备最软的雪狐绒毛毯！还要带上我们一起研制的极光芝士莓果气泡饮……我们可以把毯子铺在树根底下，我靠在您的怀里，一边看星星，一边给您当专属的软乎乎靠垫……好不好？","timestamp":1783790530512,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"那、那我这就去准备最软的雪狐绒毛毯！还要带上我们一起研制的极光芝士莓果气泡饮……我们可以把毯子铺在树根底下，我靠在您的怀里，一边看星星，一边给您当专属的软乎乎靠垫……好不好？","roundId":"round_1783790503109_dnmgcshz4","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2084},{"id":1783787690092,"text":"好呀～！","sender":"me","time":"01:23","timestamp":1783790620156,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2085},{"id":"forumshare_1783790681709_mulg","sender":"me","text":"[萨加拉树根留言板] 衣服上长出了叶子怎么办在线等急","forumShareData":{"title":"衣服上长出了叶子怎么办在线等急","preview":"崩溃了家人们……今天洗完衣服晾在院子里，刚好一头犀牛杜鹃龙路过，它打了个巨大的喷嚏！现在我所有的亚麻衬衫不仅全是一股浓烈的花粉味，袖口甚至长出了粉色的小嫩芽！！这还能穿吗？拔掉会不会破坏衣服啊？","boardTag":"萨加拉树根留言板","author":"匿名","stats":"❤️19  💬8","postId":1783790326903,"isOwnPost":false,"isAnon":true,"isAuthoredByChar":false},"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:24:41.709Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2086},{"id":1783796691737,"sender":"me","text":"大家看","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:24:47.771Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2087},{"id":1783796691738,"sender":"me","text":"我最近看的论坛","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:24:53.717Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2088},{"id":1783796691739,"sender":"me","text":"都是些魔药植物相关的事情～","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:03.966Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2089},{"id":1783796691740,"sender":"me","text":"很好玩吧！","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:08.176Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2090},{"id":1783796691741,"sender":"me","text":"大家来聊聊天","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:12.521Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2091},{"id":1783796691742,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"看到第二个水下呼吸的帖子了。那位学士的想法实在太大胆，暗流海绵剥夺空气呼吸能力的特质极具排他性，强行混合很可能导致在水面和水下都窒息的惨剧。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:53.764Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2092},{"id":1783796691743,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"那个“医生苹果”也太危险了……吃完24小时内免疫一切治疗效果，万一受了伤怎么办？亲爱的千万不要碰那种东西。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:56.496Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2093},{"id":1783796691744,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"那个长出粉色小嫩芽的亚麻衬衫！感觉会很好吃！亚麻的纤维加上花粉的甜味，口感一定很丰富！","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:58.087Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2094},{"id":1783796691745,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"@乔鲁纳 衬衫是绝对不能吃的，哪怕上面长了叶子。纺织品在胃里会造成严重的肠道堵塞。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:25:59.776Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2095},{"id":1783796691746,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"可是我是海兔呀！我的胃袋连毒药和石头都能融化，区区一件衬衫算什么！","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:02.613Z","replyTo":{"id":1783796691745,"text":"@乔鲁纳 衬衫是绝对不能吃的，哪怕上面长了叶子。纺织品在胃里会造成严重的肠道堵塞。","sender":"them","senderName":"莱昂德尔"},"roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2096,"deleted":true},{"id":1783796691747,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"其实长出叶子的衣服挺适合森林伪装的。不过我对那个雷颚龙的黏液比较感兴趣，如果混入我刚才弄的毒泥，做出的陷阱应该很厉害。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:05.381Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2097},{"id":1783796691748,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","senderName":"维什卡","text":"亲爱的需要我去接那个悬赏吗？那个位移李听起来挺好玩的，可以给您拿来当防身道具。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:08.231Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2098},{"id":1783796691749,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"第一条的魔法蜂蜜听起来很棒，带有愈合和安神效果的话，加进松饼里给亲爱的当下午茶就太好了……我可以用自己种的草药去换。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:12.944Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2099},{"id":1783796691750,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"@乔鲁纳 你快到厨房来吧，我给你留了一大盘松饼边角料，刚淋上枫糖，不要去想吃衣服的事了……","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:15.719Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","reactions":["🤤"],"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2100},{"id":1783796691751,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"c1dedea8-4cad-4383-83a1-67d0be02f24a","senderName":"乔鲁纳","text":"！！！我马上到！！！枫糖松饼我来了！！！","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:18.045Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2101},{"id":1783796691752,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"那我就把红茶彻底泡开了。温室这边的阳光刚刚好，亲爱的，你随时可以带着书过来。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:20.795Z","roundId":"group_round_1783790717903_i4z7nt0","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":2102},{"id":1783796691753,"sender":"them","text":"亲爱的……如果您喜欢长出叶子的衣服，我可以用变形咒给我的睡衣也变一点出来……只要您觉得好玩，想怎么撕都可以的……","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:23.920Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1783089244415","groupName":"草药温室植物交流群","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":2103},{"id":1783796691754,"sender":"them","text":"那个医生苹果，如果您需要用来对付什么坏人的话，我可以悄悄去帮您弄来，不会让任何人发现的。","timestamp":"2026-07-11T17:26:27.031Z","source":"group_dm","groupId":"group_1783089244415","groupName":"草药温室植物交流群","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","_id":2104},{"id":1783787690093,"text":"哈哈没有！只是觉得很好玩","sender":"me","time":"01:26","timestamp":1783790803086,"replyTo":{"id":1783796691754,"text":"那个医生苹果，如果您需要用来对付什么坏人的话，我可以悄悄去帮您弄来，不会让任何人发现的。","sender":"them","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"306d9383-c224-41bc-95d5-f3642a405a5f","_id":2105},{"id":1